WEBVTT

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:04.899
[instrumental music playing]

00:01:13.699 --> 00:01:15.117
[chattering]

00:01:22.041 --> 00:01:23.918
Your breakfast, Mr. Soliman.

00:01:24.001 --> 00:01:27.296
I don't care about cantaloupe.
It tastes like melon.

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:28.798
It will never happen again. I promise.

00:01:28.881 --> 00:01:29.882
Yalta, habibi, come back!

00:01:29.966 --> 00:01:32.510
-[butler] I'm just going to clean up.
-I'm not done yelling at you.

00:01:32.593 --> 00:01:35.137
[chuckling]

00:01:48.526 --> 00:01:50.319
Unit two, I've lost camera four.

00:01:50.403 --> 00:01:51.904
We need eyes on the rooftop terrace.

00:01:51.988 --> 00:01:52.989
<i>I'm in.</i>

00:01:53.072 --> 00:01:54.156
Okay, Mr. Shark, you're up.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.200
[Mr. Shark] Nice work, rookie.
I'm on my way.

00:01:56.284 --> 00:01:58.077
Yasmin told me
I need to be more attentive.

00:01:58.160 --> 00:01:59.203
What?

00:01:59.287 --> 00:02:01.080
-You are very attentive.
-[grunts]

00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:02.915
I know. That's what I told her.

00:02:04.208 --> 00:02:05.334
Yalta, did you get a haircut?

00:02:05.418 --> 00:02:08.087
I did. Thank you for noticing.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:09.672
It's very nice. [chuckles]

00:02:09.755 --> 00:02:10.756
All clear on the roof.

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:11.841
[Tarantula] Copy that.

00:02:11.924 --> 00:02:14.176
Uh, that was me. It's still Shark.

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:15.720
Yeah, no. I got that. Thank you.

00:02:15.803 --> 00:02:18.639
All right, Mr. Piranha. Go crazy.

00:02:26.272 --> 00:02:28.107
[Tarantula] Mr. Snake, that's your cue.

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:30.318
Hope your timing's right, kid.

00:02:30.401 --> 00:02:32.445
[Wolf] Snake, be nice to the rookie.

00:02:32.528 --> 00:02:33.529
It's her first heist.

00:02:33.612 --> 00:02:36.574
I was being nice. It's just how I sound.

00:02:36.657 --> 00:02:39.535
Welcome to the team. See?

00:02:39.618 --> 00:02:41.037
[team chuckling]

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:43.164
[Wolf] All right.
We finished with the banter?

00:02:43.247 --> 00:02:44.457
Let's do this. Come on.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.541
Five.

00:02:45.624 --> 00:02:47.251
-Four.
-Three.

00:02:47.335 --> 00:02:48.544
-Two.
-One.

00:02:48.627 --> 00:02:49.920
It's showtime!

00:02:50.421 --> 00:02:51.964
[alarm blaring]

00:03:03.559 --> 00:03:05.269
[grunts]

00:03:10.024 --> 00:03:12.360
Hello, Mr. Soliman.

00:03:16.864 --> 00:03:18.824
[wails] The Bad Guys.

00:03:18.908 --> 00:03:20.242
Remind me again.

00:03:20.326 --> 00:03:22.036
Why didn't you just
come through the front door?

00:03:22.119 --> 00:03:23.120
Where's the fun in that?

00:03:23.204 --> 00:03:24.205
He loves an entrance.

00:03:24.288 --> 00:03:26.499
Stay back! You... You monsters!

00:03:27.333 --> 00:03:29.418
-Monsters?
-[whistles]

00:03:29.502 --> 00:03:30.753
-Wow.
-Did he just say monsters?

00:03:30.836 --> 00:03:32.546
-He did.
-I wouldn't have done that.

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:33.839
You like monsters?

00:03:34.673 --> 00:03:35.674
[Mr. Soliman whimpering]

00:03:35.758 --> 00:03:37.635
I'll show you a monster, pal.

00:03:37.718 --> 00:03:39.387
-[Mr. Soliman yelps]
-[growls]

00:03:48.562 --> 00:03:50.439
No, no, no, no, no, no. Please.

00:03:53.818 --> 00:03:54.985
Okay. I see you.

00:03:55.069 --> 00:03:57.154
-Check this out.
-No, no. No, no. Please. Mr. Wolf.

00:03:57.238 --> 00:04:00.783
Oh, baby, where have
you been all my life?

00:04:00.866 --> 00:04:02.368
No! No! No, no.

00:04:02.451 --> 00:04:03.661
[Snake] Not bad. Not bad.

00:04:03.744 --> 00:04:06.622
-[Piranha] The car's really cool.
-This is a one of a kind prototype.

00:04:06.705 --> 00:04:08.916
Wait. We did all this for a car?

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.543
Listen, kid.

00:04:10.626 --> 00:04:13.462
The heist is never really
about the loot, okay?

00:04:13.546 --> 00:04:15.131
It's a power move, baby.

00:04:15.214 --> 00:04:16.215
Let's go.

00:04:16.298 --> 00:04:17.967
I have to say-- No. No. No, this--

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:19.593
It's never been driven!

00:04:19.677 --> 00:04:21.137
Don't worry.

00:04:21.637 --> 00:04:23.431
We brought you a little parting gift.

00:04:23.514 --> 00:04:24.682
We're classy like that.

00:04:25.599 --> 00:04:26.976
F-For me?

00:04:27.935 --> 00:04:28.936
[gasps]

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:31.313
[engine revs]

00:04:31.397 --> 00:04:32.982
-Nice.
-Ooh!

00:04:33.065 --> 00:04:35.067
Ooh, you say the naughtiest things.

00:04:47.163 --> 00:04:51.208
No! No! You Bad Guys will never
get away with this!

00:04:53.335 --> 00:04:54.378
[dings]

00:04:56.172 --> 00:04:57.381
[yelling, chuckling]

00:04:59.091 --> 00:05:00.342
-[gasps]
-[screams]

00:05:03.679 --> 00:05:04.680
[Wolf] Go bad...

00:05:04.763 --> 00:05:06.140
[in unison] Or go home.

00:05:06.223 --> 00:05:07.558
Whoo-hoo!

00:05:08.142 --> 00:05:09.852
["Taking Everything" playing]

00:05:12.813 --> 00:05:14.356
After them!

